    consequence: "Following Puck across the falling rooftop planks closes the return to Vivi's first-visit town route. Any uncollected Potion, Ether, Remedy, Phoenix Pinion, Eye Drops, or Tent pickup copy is lost from its original location. Each missed hidden field-item pickup also costs one Treasure Hunter point; Rank S requires 340 points (about 75% of the available total), so this sweep alone does not determine the rank.",
