    action: "Check every reported Potion spot: the Main Street starting spot, Memorial Square, both North Street candidate spots, the sewing residence, the tavern, and the steeple. Also take the Ether in the Synthesis Shop, the Remedy in the connected Weapons Shop area, the Phoenix Pinion beside the square cart, Eye Drops in Ilia's house, and the Tent by the steeple entrance. Check both reported 63-Gil locations—the lower rooftop branch and the chapel-side house—along with the other listed Gil markers. Search the full left wall of North Street because guides disagree whether it has one Potion or two.",
