    note: "VGKAMI's Alexandria item index lists seven Potions; GameFAQs and Gamer Guides support a Potion at Vivi's starting Main Street before the southbound plaza route. GameFAQs, Jegged, and Kyokugen's Japanese town map list two Potions in the northern street segment, while Gamer Guides reports one and EliteGrindLab records the conflict; sweep the awning and southern fruit-barrel candidates because the screen labels and marker descriptions do not align cleanly. Remedy descriptions range from near the counter to the arrow-marked corner or the top-right screen-transition corner; sweep the full connected Weapons Shop interior. The 63-Gil marker is described both as a rooftop/lower-house nest and as a chapel-side-house pickup, so check the lower rooftop branch and the nearby house. Jegged's Treasure Hunter reference gives one point per hidden field item and a 340-point Rank S threshold; this source formula does not prove a perfect town sweep is required.",
