    consequence: "Sources document this optional Mognet letter as Disc I mail from Mois to Gumo, with a separate handoff at Dali. If missed on the first pass, the Ice Cavern can be revisited after the boss and before Cargo Ship departure. Cour89 says the Disc II–III entrance Mois cannot give it; GameFAQs documents a distinct Disc IV repair-chain visit where Mois receives Kumool's letter at Fossil Roo and then gives another letter to Noggy. That later chain does not establish whether the original Gumo letter can be recovered there. Game8 says the early mail is not required for the Disc IV Mognet Central trophies/achievements.",
