    consequence: "The reviewed GameFAQs and RPGClassics PlayStation ability tables both list Luna on Trident, Power Break on Diamond Sword, Magic Break on Flame Saber, and Six Dragons on Heavy Lance, with no alternate equipment listed for those abilities. The same tables list Aura and Counter on Scissor Fangs and Revive and Counter on Tiger Fangs; those claw abilities have other listed equipment sources. Final Fantasy Wiki's indexed page describes the purchase as missable before Shimmering Island, and Jinsoku's Japanese limited-item list also places the purchase at Daguerreo on Disc III; Caves of Narshe lists a conflicting Disc IV Daguerreo purchase, while GameFAQs and RPGClassics omit it from their Disc IV shop tables. Keep the late purchase unverified. These are source-backed opportunities, not a claim that missing the gear permanently removes an ability.",
