    action: "If the four abilities matter to your goal, check Luna (Trident), Power Break (Diamond Sword), Magic Break (Flame Saber), and Six Dragons (Heavy Lance) before departure. Diamond Sword is also in Oeilvert's Planetarium chest; Trident is sold at the Oeilvert and Desert Palace Mogshops; Flame Saber and Heavy Lance are sold at Esto Gaza. Scissor Fangs and Tiger Fangs also teach listed abilities, but those claims have alternatives on other gear. Check your ability menus before buying duplicates.",
